ning, and automated breakdown handling."}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","li","FuelSeek Optimization",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"_0s3fAq_featureNumber","aria-hidden":"true","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"FuelSeek Optimization"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Real-time purchasing optimization driven by live diesel prices, current tank levels, and exact route needs."}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","li","Insurance & Claims Infrastructure",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"_0s3fAq_featureNumber","aria-hidden":"true","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Insurance & Claims Infrastructure"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Lower premiums and reduced claims leakage achieved through proprietary loss data and integrated accident video analysis."}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","li","Billing & Collections AI",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"_0s3fAq_featureNumber","aria-hidden":"true","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Billing & Collections AI"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Instant matching of rate confirmations to bills of lading alongside automated collections back-office workflows."}],"$undefined"]}]]}],["$","li","Workforce & Asset Automation",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"_0s3fAq_featureNumber","aria-hidden":"true","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Workforce & Asset Automation"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Custom, deeply integrated TMS, CRM, payroll, and 24/7 truck/driver utilization monitoring."}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}]
1a:["$","section",null,{"id":"about-operators","aria-labelledby":"about-operators-title","className":"Gnr7Kq_chapter Gnr7Kq_operators","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_split","children":[["$","$L16",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_sectionHead","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_label","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"03"}],"WHY SPOTTER.AI IS DIFFERENT"]}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"about-operators-title","children":"Built by Operators. Powered by AI."}]]}],["$","$L16",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_intro","delay":0.08,"children":"Many technology companies try to automate trucking from the outside. Spotter.ai was built directly inside the live operating environment."}]]}],["$","$L16",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_advantage","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_label","children":"THE SPOTTER ADVANTAGE"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Our founders combine quantitative finance, enterprise logistics software, and direct trucking operating experience. This unique DNA gives Spotter.ai a practical advantage: we are not just building tools that suggest what should happen; we are building systems that help operators make it happen."}]]}]}],["$","$L16",null,{"className":"Gnr7Kq_prose","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"We have proven our technology stack by running it inside live operations under the harshest market conditions, expanding our ecosystem around the actual, margin-critical problems carriers face every day."}]}]]}]}]
1b:["$","$L2e",null,{"id":"about-philosophy","number":"04","label":"OUR OPERATING PHILOSOPHY","title":"The Future of Freight Execution","description":"The future of logistics will be automated, verified, and data-driven. As trucking rapidly transitions away from manual workflows and relationship-based capacity, carriers need robust systems that control the entire workflow, aggregate data, enforce compliance, and automate margin-critical decisions.","paragraphs":["Spotter.ai is building that essential infrastructure layer. Our mission is to help trucking companies operate with the exact same intelligence, discipline, and automation that define the most advanced financial markets in the world."],"asset":{"id":"about-freight-horizon","src":"/brand/aboutus-videos/web/about-freight-horizon.mp4","poster":"/brand/aboutus-videos/web/about-freight-horizon.webp","sourceFile":"public/brand/aboutus-videos/Geometric_pathways_aligning_into…_1080p_20261008191503.mp4","sourceUrl":"/brand/aboutus-videos/web/about-freight-horizon.mp4","source":"client supplied","status":"client asset","license":"Owner-supplied generated film; approved for this project. Original preserved; muted all-intra web derivative and first-frame poster created locally.","alt":"Layered porcelain planes and teal paths aligning toward a softly lit horizon","width":1280,"height":720,"duration":5.958333333333333,"bytes":3286438},"features":[],"pinned":true,"className":"Gnr7Kq_philosophy"}]
